PIDSMaker
  https://github.com/ubc-provenance/PIDSMaker, Apache License 2.0.
  Upstream commit 2289cd9 builds the provenance graphs (`habitus data graphs`, run as a separate
  process; docs/upstream.patch changes the optc_h501 database name only). The research fork the
  published numbers come from matches upstream tag 2.1.1 for the files it did not change. Ported
  from it: the dataset day windows and ground-truth file lists (configs/datasets.yaml), the 15-minute
  window iteration and the node-path / event helpers of the card builder (src/habitus/data), and the
  logger interface. The ground-truth CSVs in the local result bundle are upstream files, copied
  unmodified with the upstream LICENSE next to them: the node labels of PIDSMaker's
  Ground_Truth/orthrus/ (upstream commit 2289cd9), curated by the PIDSMaker / ORTHRUS authors from the
  official DARPA TC engagement-3 ground-truth report (TC_Ground_Truth_Report_E3_Update.pdf) and the
  DARPA OpTC and ATLASv2 attack documentation. The upstream Ground_Truth/orthrus/readme.md (same
  commit) records, per attack, whether it was used or removed; it is cited here, not copied (it also
  documents hosts outside this repository's scope).

