Datasets
  DARPA Transparent Computing Engagement 3 (CADETS_E3, THEIA_E3, CLEARSCOPE_E3), DARPA OpTC
  (optc_h501) and ATLASv2 (ATLASV2_EDR) are used under their providers' terms. No raw data is
  included in this repository. The local result bundle (release/, not published) holds evidence
  cards derived from these logs (paths, command lines, addresses); see its PUBLISH.md before any
  redistribution.
